title Vinyl: Now playing's transition chip at the deck's own density (640x480, 11.3 px/mm): Crossfade 20 sec gives "Fade 20 s" beside a long format (the whole text would not fit)
sizes 640x480
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_TRANSITION crossfade_20

wait 1200
shot 01-now-crossfade-20
expect text "Fade 20 s"
expect notext "Gapless"
expect notext "Crossfade 20 s"
expect noquit
